# Working with this problem set 

This is the first problem set for INFO 241. Once you are ready to work on this problem set, you should bring the files from wherever you are storing them (i.e. GitHub) to wherever you are going to do the work on them (i.e. either your computer or the datahub). 

# Answering Questions 

Each question in stored in its own file. You should read each question, and add your response to the file. 

# Submitting Work 

All of your work should be submitted as a PDF to Gradescope. 